error[E0277]: `Column<Temp>` is not a BuilderInput; pass a registered input value to `SchedulerBuilder::with(...)`
  --> tests/trybuild/column_marker_registered.rs:14:16
   |
14 |     registered(Column::<Temp>::new());
   |     ---------- ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a BuilderInput
   |     |
   |     required by a bound introduced by this call
